  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Remove wire racks from oven. Preheat oven to <br>220°C/200°C fan-forced. <br>• Cut capsicum into bite-sized chunks.  <br>• Thinly slice red onion (see ingredients). <br>• Cut paneer cheese into 2cm chunks.  </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a41b521bcb653703ca93c02/step-57ce4900.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a medium bowl, combine paneer, half the <br>Greek-style yoghurt (see ingredients), curry <br>powder and a generous drizzle of olive oil. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a41b521bcb653703ca93c02/step-4b0cec10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over <br>medium-high heat. Add capsicum and Mumbai <br>spice blend and cook until tender and fragrant,  <br>5-6 minutes. <br>• Transfer to a large bowl, then add onion and  <br>baby spinach leaves. Drizzle with olive oil and  <br>toss to combine.  </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a41b521bcb653703ca93c02/step-92d18520.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Place large wraps directly on the wire oven racks, <br>rough-side down, then use the back of a spoon to <br>spread over passata. Season with salt and pepper.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a41b521bcb653703ca93c02/step-4a5bcc30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Top wraps with capsicum mix, marinated paneer <br>and grated mozzarella.  <br>• Bake until cheese is melted and golden, <br>10-12 minutes.   <br>TIP: Placing the pizzas directly on the wire rack helps <br>the base to crisp up. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a41b521bcb653703ca93c02/step-d8daae40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide fragrant yoghurt paneer and spinach pizzas <br>between plates.  <br>• Dollop over remaining yoghurt. <br>• Tear over coriander (see ingredients). <br>• Sprinkle with chilli flakes (if using).  <br>• Season the pizzas with black pepper and slice to <br>serve. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a41b521bcb653703ca93c02/step-fffd7b50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
